{% rawHtml
   html="  <p>\n    I’m a Backend and DevOps Engineer at Serplora Academy with over a decade of experience building production systems. After spending six years scaling services in the fintech space, I’ve developed a sharp focus on performance and clean architecture. I specialize in solving database bottlenecks and writing about how to build systems that actually last.\n  </p>\n\n  <p>\n    <strong>Expertise:</strong> Backend Development, DevOps, Performance Optimization, Cloud Architecture\n  </p>\n\n  <p>\n    <strong>Stack:</strong> Python, C/C++, C# (.NET), SQL\n  </p>" /%}
